One of the best things to have around the wizard is a ring of conflict.
EASILY worth a wish at the castle if you don't already have one.
Also: (This I haven't tried)  A ring of regeneration may let you last a
little longer against the wizard..Just make sure you have a lot of food
(usually not too much of a problem in hell) or a scroll/spell/potion of
remove curse or holy water.
Here's something that helped me, that I've never seen mentioned here or
